## 📂 8. REQUIRED FILE & DIRECTORY STRUCTURE FOR CURSOR

```
project-ar-app/
├── public/
│   ├── avatar.png                    <-- mini_me_diamond_stud_master_3d.png
│   └── audio/                        <-- MP3 voice & SFX files
├── src/
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── EnchantedCanvas.jsx      <-- Great Hall 3D floating letters, candles, spark trail
│   │   ├── Screen1Gateway.jsx       <-- Aged parchment scroll, Crimson wax seal, Gokul-Mage quote
│   │   ├── Screen2Prank.jsx         <-- 99% Sweetness Overload freeze & Kiss interaction
│   │   └── ScreenVideoMontage.jsx   <-- Intro Romantic Video Teaser
│   ├── utils/
│   │   └── audioEngine.js           <-- WebAudio manager with stopAllSFXAndVoices()
│   ├── App.jsx                       <-- State machine (gateway -> prank -> video_montage -> ar)
│   └── main.jsx
├── .cursorrules                      <-- Reference to this Master Blueprint
└── package.json
```

